{"text": "PRIOR AUTHORIZATION REQUEST -- URGENT (72 hr)                 FAX COVER + FORM, 4 pp\n\nTo:    Owyhee Senior Advantage HMO, Pharmacy UM Dept          Fax 208-555-0199\nFrom:  Boise Bench Heart Clinic, 1420 W Kootenai St Ste 210, Boise ID 83705\n       Ph (208) 555-0112   Fax 208.555.0113\nSent:  05/06/2026 14:10       Ref/PA case #: PA-26-0558713\n       (resubmission after denial DN-26-0091442 dtd 4/29/26)\n\nMEMBER\nName: Wojtowicz, Casimir T.        DOB: 11/30/1933  (age 92)     Sex: M\nMember ID: OSA904417288-01      Group: MAPD-ID-007      Medicare #: 7UF2-KD9-YT44\nAddress: 2206 N 28th St, Boise, ID 83703         Ph: 208 555 0146 (son answers; pt is hard of hearing)\n\nPRESCRIBER\nLakshmi Vemulapalli, MD, FACC -- Cardiology       NPI 1568204417     DEA FV4418823     ID lic. M-11872\nContact: Tessa (PA coordinator) ext 6, tessa.r@boisebenchheart.example\n\nDRUG REQUESTED\ntafamidis 61 mg capsule, 1 cap PO daily, #30/30 days, 12 refills\nDispensing pharmacy: Ridgecrest Specialty Pharmacy, NCPDP 1344178, ph 800-555-0164\n\nDIAGNOSIS: wild-type transthyretin amyloid cardiomyopathy (ATTR-CM), ICD-10 E85.82; HFpEF, NYHA class II;\npermanent AFib; CKD 3a.\n\nCLINICAL JUSTIFICATION (Dr. Vemulapalli):\nMr. Wojtowicz is a 92-year-old retired machinist who lives alone with daily help from his son.\nTc-99m PYP scan 03/12/2026 at Bogus Basin Imaging: grade 3 myocardial uptake, H/CL ratio 1.8. Serum/urine\nimmunofixation negative 3/3/26 (no monoclonal protein), which rules out AL. Echo 02/20/26: LVEF 52%, septum 17 mm,\nGLS -11% with apical sparing. NT-proBNP 2,840 pg/mL (2/20) -> 3,310 (4/24). Two HF admissions in 6 months\n(Dec 9-13, 2025 and 3/28-4/1/26). Current: torsemide 40 mg BID, apixaban 2.5 mg BID. 6MWT 212 m.\n\nDenial stated \"age > 90 and NYHA class not documented.\" Plan criteria (Policy RX-CARD-014, rev. 1/2026) contain no age\nlimit, and NYHA II was documented 4/24/26. Step therapy not applicable; there is no formulary alternative.\nRequest expedited review under 42 CFR § 422.572.\n\nPt/family: son and POA Stanislaw (\"Stan\") Wojtowicz, 208-555-0177, will handle the copay, est. $268/mo.\nManufacturer assistance application pending, ref VC-4417720. Stan asks that the plan NOT call his father directly.\n\nAttestation: I certify the above is accurate and supported by the chart.   /s/ L. Vemulapalli MD   05/06/26\n\nPLAN USE ONLY: Reviewer J. Twofeathers RN   Rcvd 5/6/26 14:22   Decision due 5/9/26\n[ ] Approved  [ ] Denied   Auth # ________", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "353 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Casimir T. Wojtowicz", "Lakshmi Vemulapalli", "Stan Wojtowicz", "J. Twofeathers", "RN"], "companies": ["Owyhee Senior Advantage HMO", "Boise Bench Heart Clinic", "Ridgecrest Specialty Pharmacy", "Bogus Basin Imaging", "example", "Medicare"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Boise", "Boise Bench Heart Clinic", "Bogus Basin Imaging", "Ridgecrest Specialty Pharmacy"], "health": ["wild-type transthyretin amyloid cardiomyopathy", "ATTR-CM", "HFpEF", "NYHA class II", "permanent AFib", "CKD 3a", "torsemide", "apixaban", "NT-proBNP", "gene therapy", "mitral valve stenosis"], "sensitive": ["race or ethnicity", "religion", "political views or donations", "union membership", "sexual orientation", "immigration or citizenship status", "criminal history", "genetic information"], "names": ["Casimir", "Vemulapalli", "Stan", "J"]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.19999999925494194, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 44627.20000000298, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 93, "end": 130, "text": "Owyhee Senior Advantage HMO, Pharmacy", "kind": "company", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Owyhee Senior Adv